From: Orion <orionopenwow@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] openvanilla: Duels betting in Duel Gold (spectators' pools and the fighters' stakes)

Modes roadmap Phase 3 (owner, 2026-10-22: "add betting on duels, win gold for wagering, bet on players
in spectate"). Duel Gold is its own currency on the Duels realm: a wallet per account (duels_wallet),
topped back up to the start each day, a prize for each rated win; nothing buys it and it never leaves
the realm. Spectators bet on a rated duel until round one starts (pari-mutuel: the winners share the
pool; part of the losing side is burned; no bet on the winner, a draw or a cancel = all back). Both
fighters may offer a stake before round one; equal offers are taken from both and the winner gets both.
Fair play: no bets on your own fight, from its fighters' accounts or network address, one bet a match,
a cap a bet and a day. Off unless OpenVanilla.Duels.Betting = 1. See WarfrontArena.h.

