+ * Betting (patch 0027, OpenVanilla.Duels.Betting = 1): Duel Gold, earned and won, never bought, this realm only
+ *   (duels_wallet, by account: .Betting.Start 100, topped back up to it each day; .WinPrize 10 a rated win).
+ *   Commands: wallet   pool <match>   bet <match> <side 0|1> <gold>   stake <gold> (a fighter, before round one)
+ *   Lines: wallet,<gold>,<max a bet>,<left today>   pool,<match>,<gold on 0>,<on 1>,<open 0|1>,<seconds left>,<my side|-1>,<mine>
+ *     bet,ok,<match>,<side>,<gold>,<wallet>   bet,won|lost|back,<match>,<gold>,<wallet>   bet,err,<why>
+ *     stake,offer,<mine>,<theirs>   stake,on,<gold>   stake,off   stake,won|lost|back,<gold>   stake,err,<why>
+ *   Bets close when round one starts. Rated duels only; never on a fight you are in, from its fighters'
+ *   accounts or network address; one bet a match, .Betting.Max (100) a bet, .Betting.Daily (500) a day.
+ *   The winners share the pool in proportion; .Betting.BurnPercent (5) of the losing side is burned. No bet on
+ *   the winner, a draw or a cancelled match: every bet comes back.
  * Rules: 60 s preparation (rooted, both teams friendly), flasks/elixirs/world buffs removed and
  * health, mana and cooldowns up to 10 minutes reset on entry; 15 minutes, then the team with more
  * health left wins; leaving a rated match is a loss and locks the queue for 15 minutes; teams may
